WEBVTT

1
00:00:10.667 --> 00:00:18.090
Riley: Taking care of a snake is fun!

2
00:00:18.091 --> 00:00:20.736
Snooks: Woof! Woof!

3
00:00:20.737 --> 00:00:23.939
Theo: Look, Snooks is jealous!

4
00:00:23.940 --> 00:00:29.959
Riley: He wants all the attention.

5
00:00:29.960 --> 00:00:33.061
Sarah: Can I hold Sammy now?

6
00:00:33.062 --> 00:00:35.691
Skyler: I'm next!

7
00:00:35.692 --> 00:00:46.531
Theo: I'm after Skyler.

8
00:00:46.532 --> 00:00:49.634
Theo: Kelli, do you want to hold Sammy?

9
00:00:49.635 --> 00:00:54.340
Kelli: Get that thing out of here!

10
00:00:54.341 --> 00:00:56.403
Sarah: I think he's cute.

11
00:00:56.404 --> 00:01:02.554
I wish my mom would let me get a snake.

12
00:01:02.555 --> 00:01:04.691
Ben: It's time to feed Sammy.

13
00:01:04.692 --> 00:01:07.427
I'll get the snake food.

14
00:01:07.428 --> 00:01:14.657
Sarah: Snake food! Yuck!

15
00:01:14.658 --> 00:01:16.912
Theo: Sammy loves it.

16
00:01:16.913 --> 00:01:20.964
Skyler: He's very hungry.

17
00:01:20.965 --> 00:01:23.027
Ben: Don't gobble, Sammy.

18
00:01:23.028 --> 00:01:30.225
You'll get a stomachache.

19
00:01:30.226 --> 00:01:35.139
Skyler: Hey, look at Johnny's fish aquarium!

20
00:01:35.140 --> 00:01:42.953
Riley: My fish, Goldie and Goofy, would love an aquarium.

21
00:01:42.954 --> 00:01:47.530
Skyler: Maybe we can save money from pet-sitting jobs.

22
00:01:47.531 --> 00:01:51.735
Theo: And buy toys and treats for our pets!

23
00:01:51.736 --> 00:01:55.264
Sarah: I could buy a new collar for Mittens.

24
00:01:55.265 --> 00:02:03.341
Theo: I could build Frankie a frog house.

25
00:02:03.342 --> 00:02:09.775
Ben: Sammy is finished eating now.

26
00:02:09.776 --> 00:02:13.567
Riley: The food made a bump in his stomach.

27
00:02:13.568 --> 00:02:16.537
Sarah: Does Sammy want dessert?

28
00:02:16.538 --> 00:02:24.342
Ben: I don't think snakes eat dessert.

29
00:02:24.343 --> 00:02:26.141
Ben: Good-bye, Sammy.

30
00:02:26.142 --> 00:02:28.885
Sarah: We'll see you tomorrow.

31
00:02:28.886 --> 00:02:32.421
Theo: Wait! Something is wrong!

32
00:02:32.422 --> 00:02:34.776
Riley: What's the matter, Theo?

33
00:02:34.777 --> 00:02:42.484
Theo: It's my hamster, Whiskers. He's gone!
